# Op4_SaveDrawPos: an a4 object with a nonzero radius (ruling 5, 2), at its first call: the radius
# word $26(a6) = $20, so the saved draw position is the centre plus radius x (sin, cos) of the
# heading $2A(a5). A real state: VM4_SpawnChild_InitMotion stores the spawn's radius d2 (or its
# parameter table's, e.g. the spawns at $013148-$0131E6 with tables) at +$26; the corpus's users
# of this op all had radius 0.

case radius
w a6 + $26 = $0020
